# Public, build-time values (inlined into the static pages by `astro build`).
# Copy to .env (gitignored) locally; in Cloudflare Workers Builds set them as build variables.

# None is needed: no page reads a build-time key since the enquiry form was removed (November 2026).

# Leave empty. Set, it only makes the privacy policy describe Google Ads; no page loads an Ads tag.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_ID=
